<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UAL Corp rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UAL Corp rating cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal has cut its rating on shares of UAL Corp to outperform (speculative) from outperform, the brokerage firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Gruntal cited the stock's 25-percent rise so far in March as a signal to take profits.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Chicago-based holding company for United Airlines traded at 68-3/4 on Monday, down 1-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
